# Object Property: obo:PREFER_8000021 (has denominator unit)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_8000021 "x has_denominator_unit y iff x and y are units, and x is ratio unit where y is the denominator of it.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:PREFER_8000021 "Not using RO:0020203 as range/domain does not fit with modelling.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PREFER_8000021 "has denominator unit"@en)

# Object Property: obo:PREFER_8000022 (has numerator unit)

