# Class: obo:PREFER_0000067 (ez2-Control - Getinge bioreactor)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.getinge.com/int/products/applikon-ez2-control/") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_0000067 "A bench-scale bioprocess control system produced by Getinge that monitors and regulates cultivation parameters through integrated control software, sensor interfaces, fluid handling components, and gas management functions. The ez2-control is a conventional bioreactor control system designed to operate and regulate individual bioreactor units.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:PREFER_0000067 "Applikon ez2-Control - Getinge bioreactor")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:PREFER_0000067 "Former manufacturer is Applikon Biotechnology")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:PREFER_0000067 "This system is classified as a bioreactor due to its use in conjunction with biological cultivation workflows. However, the ez2-Control is not strictly a bioreactor. Rather, it is a bioprocess control system that enables customizable configurations for efficient control and optimization of fermentation processes.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PREFER_0000067 "ez2-Control - Getinge bioreactor"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:PREFER_0000067 obo:PREFER_0000014)
