# Class: obo:PREFER_0000070 (BioLector XT - Beckman Coulter bioreactor)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.mybeckman.dk/microbioreactor/biolector-xt") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_0000070 "A microbioreactor-scale high-throughput bioreactor system produced by Beckman Coulter Life Sciences for parallel cultivation of microbial or cell cultures simultaneously in up to 48-well microtiter plates (MTPs), each with a culture volume in the microliter range. It provides online optical monitoring of biomass, fluorescence, pH, and dissolved oxygen (DO) under orbital shaking conditions, using integrated pre-calibrated sensor technology and optional microfluidic modules for automated feeding and pH control.")
