# Class: obo:PREFER_0000150 (data acquisition quality)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_0000150 "A quality that inheres in data or samples and specifies how, where, and when measurements are obtained in a bioreactor or fermentation system during the process.")
