AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_0000182 "An operation mode control variable in which additional nutrients, through feed medium, are intermittently or continuously supplied to the bioreactor or fermentar system during a fermentation process, without removal of production culture fluid, until termination of the fermentation process.")
