# Class: obo:PREFER_8000041 (Ambr250 - Satorius bioreactor)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://www.sartorius.com/en/products/fermentation-bioreactors/ambr-multi-parallel-bioreactors/ambr-250-high-throughput") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_8000041 "A bench-scale bioreactor system produced by Sartorius with individual vessel working volumes ranging from 100 to 250 mL. The Ambr250 is an automated, high-throughput, parallel  mini-bioreactor platform that can handle 12-24 independent vessels simultaneously. It supports mammalian, insect, and microbial cell cultures, and includes automated liquid handling for process monitoring and control.
The system provides a highly controlled cultivation environment, and an efficient and rapid scale-down platform for evaluating a wide range of process conditions and strains, with scalability to both bench-scale and larger stirred tank bioreactors.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:PREFER_8000041 "Ambr250 - Satorius bioreactor"@en)
SubClassOf(obo:PREFER_8000041 obo:PREFER_0000014)
SubClassOf(obo:PREFER_8000041 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:PREFER_8000008 obo:PREFER_0000186))

