AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref "https://frings.com/en/produkte/proreact-p-production-bioreactors/") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:PREFER_8000058 "A pilot-scale stirred-tank bioreactor produced by Frings with a working volume of approximately 100 liters, integrated with the Lucullus process information management platform for automated monitoring, control, and data acquisition during biological cultivation processes. The system is intended for research, process development, and scale-up studies and is designed with automation and operational concepts comparable to industrial production processes.")
